        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、LTI系统中微分方程为：  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y''(t) + 5y'(t) + 6y(t) = 2x'(t) + 3x(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(0^-) = 2"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y'(0^-) = 1"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，输入信号  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x(t) = u(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，请用时域分析法求：系统的自由响应和强迫响应。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                109,
                811,
                176
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\alpha^ {2} + 5 \\alpha + 6 = (\\alpha + 2) (\\alpha + 3) = 0",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/768798eb8608dcea17807397b2760c4bd562e5bc59dc22fcbb0394ac9852097d.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                250,
                182,
                512,
                212
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "2 x (t) + 3 x (t) = 2 \\sqrt {1 - t} + 3 u (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/e10b392b0e2a45ca6ab70b579066a318c8fde53b21fafd891cd84682202e49f7.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                584,
                182,
                845,
                216
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\alpha_ {1} = - 2, \\quad \\alpha_ {2} = - 3",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/4d5ca385dd008d14db9c246ca7d8e6eed814b9a7dc8e08411f078123b161c067.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                265,
                220,
                433,
                245
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y _ {n} (t) = A e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/737e95c93d5889212c4638ed8c85c3ffad2ac3bfec482f31fc928c994ad2870d.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                257,
                250,
                482,
                290
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "切时的项  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "= 3 \\Rightarrow  {y}_{p + 1} = c"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                586,
                224,
                912,
                260
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "0 + 0 + 6 c = 3",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/31984c1df6e709252a7eb8e2908fed2b44ac49066675f50c061af0701357aef8.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                623,
                260,
                776,
                288
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "c = \\frac {1}{2}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/cf8c93f5261f76dddfea82348e755b8f246169baa6da25dfe4c6754fb9710e57.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                670,
                288,
                746,
                317
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y _ {p} | t | = \\frac {1}{2}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/4bdc0d97fc012f262783395c6067fe7789c898a3786d5ff45975fcd1b65f8d87.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                660,
                318,
                759,
                356
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y | t | = y _ {h} | t | + y _ {p} | t | = A e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{2}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/e9cb1f5c5e2223696cb6268587ae8179031f067bf363b253096958bf4c9c42b8.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                369,
                358,
                751,
                408
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 5 y ^ {\\prime} | t | + 6 y | t | = 2 0 (t) + 3 u (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ce4cc547103f3ba8fa5dc1cb512fe3f7318f9d329edf44a17015608eea355d6e.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                352,
                412,
                684,
                454
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta (1 + t) \\Rightarrow a = 2",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/1fa86e33738567ec8d8514254d4c36d0ff31ce74c2f6ae3951fecf834742b43a.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                386,
                454,
                680,
                492
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y ^ {\\prime} | t | = a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y ^ {\\prime} (0 + 1) = y ^ {\\prime} (0 - 1) + a = 3",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/69d9c0fcdf051b3d228ad3400ce404cdc88da90522fad7137882375c0115126b.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                386,
                486,
                737,
                526
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y (t) = a t \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow y (0 + 1) = y (0 - 1) = 2",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ecb8cc48b7d13afc93f0b1c765f1e5abfc4eb0abe4c3b85fd62d69369049608b.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                391,
                524,
                689,
                559
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y (u + 1) = A + B + \\frac {1}{2} = 2 \\\\ y (0 + 1) = - 2 A - 3 B = 3 \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} A = \\frac {1 5}{2} \\\\ B = - 6 \\end{array} \\right.",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/fb3a91ababfde3593bd31e87409994e459b5a1c54e248f26378a94c9fdb3a760.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                394,
                557,
                789,
                635
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "y (t) = \\left(\\frac {1 5}{2} e ^ {- 2 t} - 6 e ^ {- 3 t} + \\frac {1}{2}\\right) u (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/98f0a93e18ff604b99eaed05ca853077afcb3c324b6cb3e614c92ef12414c3ea.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                391,
                635,
                734,
                682
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "自由向应为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left(\\frac{15}{2}e^{-2t}-6e^{-3t}\\right)uHt"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                394,
                682,
                747,
                724
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "强矩响应为   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{1}{2}u(t)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
